This example wicked-estate language plugin (the nginx grammar, query, and manifest in this
directory) is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

It is licensed DELIBERATELY under a different license than wicked-estate itself (which is MIT) to
demonstrate the point of the plugin system: a plugin is a separate artifact, loaded at runtime and
never linked into the wicked-estate core, so its license never affects the core's license. A plugin
could just as well be GPL-3.0 — the mechanism is identical and the core stays MIT-clean.

The full Apache License 2.0 text is available at: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
